Subject: [PATCH 2/2] UI-FIT: weak no-op gate API for the other native tools,
 status with the measurements

The part_icons tool and the other native programs that link the core objects got
undefined tf_* symbols from the new DOOMO_TEXTFIT enumerators (make check-gen failed).
core/src/stubs.c now has weak no-ops, native build only; the unit tests define the
real ones. Status file: memory numbers and the gates that ran.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Xd63czLgdbSn871LSJKjVC
---
 core/src/stubs.c              | 18 ++++++++++++++++++
 docs/design/held/status/UI.md |  2 +-
 2 files changed, 19 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/core/src/stubs.c b/core/src/stubs.c
index 5a15a12..c12e7ae 100644
--- a/core/src/stubs.c
+++ b/core/src/stubs.c
@@ -1383,3 +1383,21 @@ WEAK const uint8_t *look_pool_find(int id, int kind, int *len)
 WEAK int  look_pool_put(int id, int kind, const uint8_t *data, int len)
 { (void)id; (void)kind; (void)data; (void)len; STUB("look_pool_put"); return 0; }
 WEAK void look_pool_drop(int id) { (void)id; STUB("look_pool_drop"); }
+
+#if defined(DOOMO_TEXTFIT) && DOOMO_TEXTFIT
+/* (UI-FIT) the text-fit gate's API (doomo/textfit.h): the enumerators of the screens' files call it; the unit
+ * tests define it (core/tests/textfit_engine.c), the other native tools that link the core get these no-ops.
+ * Native build only: the consoles compile none of it. */
+#include "doomo/textfit.h"
+WEAK int tf_sw(const TfScreen *s) { (void)s; return 240; }
+WEAK int tf_sh(const TfScreen *s) { (void)s; return 160; }
+WEAK int tf_big(const TfScreen *s) { (void)s; return 0; }
+WEAK int tf_lang(const TfScreen *s) { (void)s; return 0; }
+WEAK void tf_state(TfScreen *s, const char *fmt, ...) { (void)s; (void)fmt; }
+WEAK void tf_text(TfScreen *s, const char *what, const char *str, int x, int y, int w, int maxlines, int flags)
+{ (void)s; (void)what; (void)str; (void)x; (void)y; (void)w; (void)maxlines; (void)flags; }
+WEAK void tf_block(TfScreen *s, const char *what, int x, int y, int w, int h)
+{ (void)s; (void)what; (void)x; (void)y; (void)w; (void)h; }
+WEAK void tf_fit(TfScreen *s, const char *what, int need_w, int avail_w)
+{ (void)s; (void)what; (void)need_w; (void)avail_w; }
+#endif
